# AI Chatbot Using Natural Language Processing (NLP)

## 1. Project Overview

The AI Chatbot using NLP is a web-based chatbot developed using Python, Natural Language Processing, and Machine Learning. It is designed to understand user messages, identify their intent, and generate relevant responses.

The application uses Flask to provide a web interface, NLTK for text preprocessing, and Scikit-learn for intent classification. It also uses a knowledge base to retrieve relevant information when a suitable response is not available through intent classification.

## 2. Project Objectives

- Develop an interactive chatbot using NLP and Machine Learning.
- Process and normalize user input for better text understanding.
- Classify user messages into predefined intents.
- Generate relevant responses and handle unknown queries.
- Evaluate model performance using test data and evaluation metrics.
- Provide a simple web interface for users to interact with the chatbot.

