## 10. Limitations

- The chatbot primarily supports predefined intents and patterns.
- It may misunderstand unfamiliar or ambiguous queries.
- Its responses depend on the quality and coverage of the training dataset.
- The knowledge base has limited coverage.
- The Flask development server is intended for local development, not production deployment.

## 11. Future Enhancements

