- Integrate a larger knowledge base or Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG).
- Add user feedback and conversation history.
- Deploy the application using a production-ready hosting environment.

## 12. Conclusion

This project demonstrates how Natural Language Processing and Machine Learning can be combined to develop a functional chatbot. It provides practical experience in text preprocessing, intent classification, model evaluation, knowledge retrieval, and web application development.

The project can serve as a foundation for building more advanced conversational systems.

